  "description": "<div style='text-align:Left;font-size:12pt'><div><div><p><span>AC Transit District boundaries, within the extent of Alameda County. Boundaries represent voting districts (i.e., district assignment for each address) and may align with parcel boundaries in cases where parcels (and sometimes residences) are divided by the true city/district boundary.<\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div><div><div><p><span /><\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div>",
